		<descript Sync="TRUE">
			<abstract>The Esri shapefile CACB_open_pits is a spatial database that provides spatial and descriptive information for sediment-hosted copper open-pit mines of the Central African Copperbelt, Democratic Republic of the Congo (DRC) and Zambia.</abstract>
			<purpose>The spatial database was created for use in a geographic information system (GIS) as part of Scientific Investigations Series Report 2010-5090-T, which is part of the USGS assessment of undiscovered copper resources of the world. It provides locations of open-pit mines, in addition to descriptive information for use in a GIS and for estimating undiscovered mineral resource endowments.</purpose>
		</descript>
